New version of the adc stm32 driver and  DTS where the adc clock prescaler has two properties to be combined:

- st,adc-prescaler-type :    SYNC  or  ASYNC 
- st,adc-prescaler:  value 1 .. 256

DTS now looks like :
```
&adc1 {
	st,adc-prescaler-type = <SYNC>;
	st,adc-prescaler = <2>;
};
```

If one property is present, the other is required. 
Note that, depending on the stm32 serie,  not all combinations are valid (ex <SYNC> and <64>)
